马光","text":"菡萏飘零水寂寥，败荷疏柳共萧条。\n烟斜雨细愁无限，醇酒千分不易消。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23992,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"景仁思归雨未克行以诗留之","author":"司马光","text":"嘉客念归程，泥深未可行。\n今朝阴又重，春雨亦多情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23993,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游喷玉潭 其一","author":"司马光","text":"惊风动地起，游客望山行。\n若待佳辰去，应无好事名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23994,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游喷玉潭 其二","author":"司马光","text":"万木吼穹谷，驽骀屹不前。\n犹胜望尘客，伫立九衢边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23995,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"登长安见山楼","author":"司马光","text":"到官今十日，才得一朝闲。\n岁晚愁云合，登楼不见山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23996,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"集句诗","author":"司马光","text":"年去年来来去忙，暂偷闲卧老僧床。\n惊回一觉游仙梦，又逐流莺过短墙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23997,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叠石溪 其二","author":"司马光","text":"山鸟劝人饮，山蝉笑我狂。\n归时兴未尽，不得看斜阳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23998,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"叠石溪 其一","author":"司马光","text":"道傍行采药，石底卧题名。\n野老相迎拜，溪童乍见惊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":23999,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"司马光","text":"昨日春冰破水边，今朝腊雪坠风前。\n岁华过目疾飞鸟，壮志如何不着鞭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24000,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"数日不至后圃今晚偶来芳物都尽率然成诗","author":"司马光","text":"烂漫不解赏，飘零空惨悽。\n残红正满地，不忍踏芳蹊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24001,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞部刘员外约游金明光以贱事失期刘惠诗见嘲以诗四首谢之 其二","author":"司马光","text":"绛阙朝归散玉珂，不游不饮奈春何。\n皇仁听使欢娱极，白简从君冷峭多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24002,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞部刘员外约游金明光以贱事失期刘惠诗见嘲以诗四首谢之 其一","author":"司马光","text":"丝管嘈嘈耳不分，绮罗杂踏自成春。\n不唯汉帝昆明小，更觉唐家曲水贫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24003,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"虞部刘员外约游金明光以贱事失期刘惠诗见嘲以诗四首谢之 其三","author":"司马光","text":"碧柳红桃照眼春，绮肴芳醴集朝绅。\n自嫌林野疏顽迹，难预风流席上宾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24004,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬王安之谢药栽二章 其二","author":"司马光","text":"护根带土我亲移，荷锸汲泉君自种。\n悦目宁将恶草殊，扶危或比兼金重。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24005,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬王安之谢药栽二章 其一","author":"司马光","text":"洛人栽花不栽药，吾属好尚何其偏。\n服之虽能已百疾，爱闲成僻无由痊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24006,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"酬尧夫招看牡丹 其一","author":"司马光","text":"君家牡丹深浅红，二十四枝为一丛。\n不唯春光占七八，才华自是诗人雄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":24007,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]